## Features

- ✅ **SFD** — Stochastic Fisher Diagonal optimizer (Adam + Fisher information diagonal)
- ✅ **SophiaSOAP** — Hybrid second-order optimizer combining Sophia, SOAP/K-FAC, MARS, and spectral normalization
- ✅ **6 LR Schedulers** — Cosine annealing, polynomial, exponential, one-cycle, Sophia-style (Hessian-adaptive)
- ✅ **Mixed Precision Training** — FP4 / FP8 / FP16 working weights with FP32 master weights and dynamic loss scaling
- ✅ **NVIDIA B200 Support** — Tensor Memory (TMEM) pooling, FP4 Tensor Core fusion, kernel op-fusion (GEMM+Bias+Act)
- ✅ **Bayesian HPO** — Gaussian Process surrogate model with Expected Improvement acquisition
- ✅ **Reversible Networks** — Adaptive cache/recompute policy for memory-efficient backpropagation
- ✅ **Multiple Allocator Backends** — Arena, Pool, Slab, Buddy allocator support
- ✅ **Serialization** — Binary checkpoint save/load for optimizer states and tensors
- ✅ **Built-in Telemetry** — Per-step GPU utilization, memory, Tensor Core, and NVLink tracking

