## Known Issues & Limitations

> These are identified bugs in the current implementation that must be addressed
> before production use.

| # | Location | Description | Severity |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `KFACBlock.computeInverseSqrt` | Double-free: `defer Y.deinit()` fires after `Y = Y_new` reassignment | 🔴 Critical |
| 2 | `SophiaSOAP.updateHessianDiagonal` | EMA update `h.* = α·h + (1−α)·h` is a no-op — Hessian never changes | 🔴 Critical |
| 3 | `SophiaSOAP.updateHessianDiagonal` | `params_plus`/`params_minus` are computed but never used in the finite-difference formula | 🟠 High |
| 4 | `Tensor.copyFromWithCast` | Does not perform any type casting; simply calls `copyFrom` | 🟡 Medium |
| 5 | `fillRandomNormal` / `fillRademacher` | PRNG seeded with `std.time.timestamp()` — same seed if called within the same second | 🟡 Medium |
| 6 | `B200Profiler.captureGPUMetrics` | Returns hardcoded values (85% GPU, 90% TC util) — no real GPU integration | 🔵 Info |
| 7 | `convertToFP4` | Only sets a flag; performs no actual quantization | 🔵 Info |

